.TH MIDSYNTH 1
.SH NAME
midsynth \- command-line tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B midsynth
.SH DESCRIPTION
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/midsynth -in PORT [options] > output.pcm
Output: 48000 Hz, stereo, signed 16-bit little-endian PCM.
  -bank int
    	built-in ADL bank number
  -cards int
    	number of OPL3 cards (1..100) (default 4)
  -four-ops int
    	hardware 4-op channels (-1 selects automatically) (default -1)
  -in int
    	MIDI input port number (required) (default -1)
  -list
    	list MIDI input ports on stderr
